<title>ROMANIA: SOCCER-ROMANIA CRUSH LIECHTENSTEIN 8-0.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ROMANIA CRUSH LIECHTENSTEIN 8-0.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania beat Liechtenstein</p>
<p>8-0 (halftime 3-0) in their World Cup group eight qualifying</p>
<p>match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Viorel Moldovan 10, Gheorghe Popescu 28, 30, 68,</p>
<p>82, Gheorghe Hagi 47, Dan Petrescu 49, Gheorghe Craioveanu 71</p>
<p>Attendance - 2,500</p>
<p>Standings:</p>
<p> Romania		4   4   0   0  18   0   12</p>
<p> Ireland		3   2   1   0   8   0   7</p>
<p> Macedonia	    5   2   1   2  15   8   7</p>
<p> Lithuania	    3   2   0   1   4   4   6</p>
<p> Iceland		4   0   2   2   1   7   2</p>
<p> Liechtenstein	5   0   0   5   2  29   0</p>
<p>Remaining matches:</p>
<p>1997:</p>
<p>April 2  - Lithuania v Romania</p>
<p>April 3  - Macedonia v Ireland</p>
<p>April 30 - Romania v Ireland</p>
<p>April 30 - Liechtenstein v Lithuania</p>
<p> June 7   - Ireland v Liechtenstein</p>
<p> June 7   - Macedonia v Iceland</p>
<p>June 11  - Iceland v Lithuania</p>
<p> Aug 19   - Liechtenstein v Iceland</p>
<p> Aug 20   - Ireland v Lithuania</p>
<p> Aug 20   - Romania v Macedonia</p>
<p> Sept 6   - Liechtenstein v Romania</p>
<p> Sept 6   - Iceland v Ireland</p>
<p> Sept 6   - Lithuania v Macedonia</p>
<p>Sept 10  - Romania v Iceland</p>
<p>Sept 10  - Lithuania v Ireland</p>
<p> Oct 11   - Ireland v Romania</p>
<p> Oct 11   - Iceland v Liechtenstein</p>
<p> Oct 11   - Macedonia v Lithuania</p>
